{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_goblin_camp_destroyed","model_identifier":"lair_goblin_camp_destroyed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_goblin_camp_destroyed\n\nlair_goblin_camp_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_goblin_camp.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 16 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -100.0..100.0, y 0.0..14.0, z -102.0..90.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- flattened tents and debris, all under 10 u high: one box 190 x 10 x 150 centred on x = 0, z = 25\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tents pulled down flat and scorched, poles broken, the fire out (ash and scattered stones), the totem chopped down beside its stump, the crate smashed.\n"},"description":"# lair_goblin_camp_destroyed\n\nlair_goblin_camp_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_goblin_camp.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 16 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -100.0..100.0, y 0.0..14.0, z -102.0..90.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- flattened tents and debris, all under 10 u high: one box 190 x 10 x 150 centred on x = 0, z = 25\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tents pulled down flat and scorched, poles broken, the fire out (ash and scattered stones), the totem chopped down beside its stump, the crate smashed.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"tr